    text: 'On 10 July 1976 a reactor at the ICMESA chemical plant near Seveso, north of Milan, released a toxic cloud containing the dioxin TCDD over surrounding towns; the fact that dioxin had been emitted was not disclosed publicly for about a week, and the contamination led to the European Union\'s "Seveso" directive on major industrial hazards.',
