        community: 'EXPERT_LITERATURE',
        occurredAt: '2024-01-01',
        datePrecision: 'YEAR',
        reason: 'The marriage is corroborated by the Han Shu "Treatise on the Xiongnu" and is treated in modern scholarship as the settled culmination of the heqin diplomacy opened by Huhanye\'s 51 BCE submission, inaugurating a long peace on the Han–Xiongnu frontier. Wang Zhaojun, given the Xiongnu title Ninghu Yanzhi ("Yanzhi who pacifies the Hu"), became one of the most enduring figures of later Chinese legend, but the dated court event of 33 BCE is uncontested.',
