    externalId: 'trajectory:landa-auto-de-fe-mani-1562',
    text: 'On 12 July 1562 the Franciscan provincial Diego de Landa staged an auto-da-fé at Maní in Yucatán, burning a large number of Maya hieroglyphic books (27 by his own count) and some five thousand cult images — destroying nearly the entire written corpus of the Maya in a single act.',
