    text: 'In a public controlled field trial at Pouilly-le-Fort, animals vaccinated by Louis Pasteur\'s team with an attenuated anthrax vaccine on 5 and 17 May 1881 and then all challenged with virulent anthrax on 31 May survived, while the unvaccinated controls died — the result revealed before some 200 spectators on 2 June 1881.',
