        reason: 'Pasteur reported the Meister case and a second cure (the shepherd Jean-Baptiste Jupille) to the Académie des sciences on 26 October 1885, and within a year thousands of bite victims travelled to Paris for treatment. Public subscription funded the Institut Pasteur, inaugurated on 14 November 1888 to mass-produce the vaccine and study infectious disease; post-exposure rabies prophylaxis became standard practice worldwide.',
