    text: 'On 26 April 1478, during High Mass in the Cathedral of Florence, conspirators of the Pazzi family attacked the ruling Medici brothers: Giuliano de\' Medici was stabbed to death at the altar while Lorenzo de\' Medici was wounded but escaped, defeating the plot to overthrow Medici rule of Florence.',
