        datePrecision: 'DAY',
        reason: 'Shortly after midnight on 31 August 1997 the Mercedes carrying Diana, Dodi Fayed and driver Henri Paul, pursued by paparazzi on motorcycles, crashed into the thirteenth pillar of the Pont de l\'Alma underpass; Dodi Fayed and Paul died at the scene and Diana died of her injuries at the Pitié-Salpêtrière hospital later that morning. The death of the Princess of Wales was reported worldwide within hours and triggered an extraordinary public outpouring of grief.',
