        reason: 'Ilya Frank and Igor Tamm produced the theoretical explanation: the glow arises when a charged particle travels through a medium faster than the phase velocity of light in that medium, an electromagnetic analogue of a sonic boom. The Frank–Tamm theory quantitatively matched Cherenkov\'s measurements, establishing the effect as a genuine physical phenomenon.',
