        occurredAt: '2014-02-07',
        datePrecision: 'DAY',
        reason: 'On 7 February 2014 Mt. Gox abruptly halted all bitcoin withdrawals, saying it needed "a clear technical view of the currency processes" — publicly attributing the problem to transaction malleability. The freeze, followed by the suspension of all trading on 24–25 February as the site went dark, signalled to the market that the dominant exchange was in crisis and moved its insolvency from rumour onto the record.',
