    text: 'After La Pérouse\'s ships Boussole and Astrolabe sailed from Botany Bay on 10 March 1788 and vanished, the expedition\'s fate remained a 40-year mystery until Peter Dillon located the wreck site at Vanikoro in 1827, confirming the ships had been wrecked there.',
