        reason: 'Eugenio Beltrami\'s 1868 construction of a Euclidean model (the pseudosphere) on which Lobachevskian geometry is realised proves the new geometry is exactly as logically consistent as Euclid\'s — settling that the parallel postulate is independent of the others. Lobachevsky\'s posthumous reputation is secured; non-Euclidean geometry becomes a foundation of modern mathematics and, later, of Einstein\'s general relativity.',
