    text: 'Shortly after midnight on 25 February 1956, Nikita Khrushchev delivered the speech "On the Cult of Personality and Its Consequences" to a closed session of the 20th Congress of the Communist Party of the Soviet Union, denouncing Stalin\'s purges and repression — the official Soviet acknowledgment of crimes long suppressed.',
