    text: 'Léon Foucault demonstrated the rotation of the Earth directly with a freely swinging pendulum whose plane of oscillation slowly rotates; he communicated the result to the Académie des sciences in Paris on 3 February 1851 and made the famous public demonstration under the dome of the Panthéon on 26 March 1851.',
