    text: 'Palestinian leader Yasser Arafat died at a French military hospital near Paris on 11 November 2004 after a rapid illness; the cause of his death has never been settled — a 2013 Swiss forensic study of his exhumed remains reported elevated polonium-210 consistent with poisoning, while French investigators concluded in 2015 that he died of natural causes, leaving the question unresolved.',
