        reason: 'After falling gravely ill at his besieged Ramallah compound in late October 2004, Arafat was flown to the Percy military hospital in Clamart, near Paris, where he lapsed into a coma and was pronounced dead at 03:30 on 11 November 2004 at the age of 75. His death was reported worldwide, but the French medical file recorded no definitive cause, and from the outset Palestinian officials and Arafat\'s widow alleged he had been poisoned, leaving the cause of death disputed.',
