        reason: 'A separate French forensic team found the polonium and lead to be of environmental origin, and in 2015 French prosecutors concluded Arafat had died of natural causes; a French Court of Appeal confirmed in June 2016 that it had not been demonstrated that Arafat was murdered by polonium-210 poisoning. With the Swiss and French expert teams reaching opposing conclusions from the same decayed remains, the cause of Arafat\'s death stands as an unresolvable forensic question rather than a settled fact.',
