        reason: 'A Chilean judicial investigation reopened the case and ordered Allende\'s remains exhumed. An international forensic team, examining the skull and the ballistics of the wounds, unanimously concluded on 19 July 2011 that the injuries were self-inflicted by a rifle fired under the chin on automatic — consistent with suicide and inconsistent with execution by attacking soldiers. Allende\'s own family accepted the finding, settling the long-disputed cause of his death.',
