        reason: 'Within weeks laboratories worldwide failed to reproduce STAP, and scrutiny revealed duplicated and manipulated images and text lifted from other sources. A RIKEN investigation committee found Obokata guilty of research misconduct; on 2 July 2014 Nature retracted both papers. RIKEN\'s verification effort that year could not generate any STAP cells, and the affair was compounded by the August 2014 suicide of project leader Yoshiki Sasai. The supposed phenomenon was overturned as an artefact of error and fabrication.',
