    text: 'On 14 April 1498 Vasco da Gama\'s fleet anchored at the Swahili city-state of Malindi (in present-day Kenya) after a hostile reception at Mombasa on 7 April; the friendly sultan of Malindi furnished a pilot who guided the Portuguese across the Indian Ocean to India, and the voyage produced the first detailed European eyewitness record of the Swahili coast city-states.',
