        reason: 'Excavating a long-looted ruin earlier identified as the mysterious "Site Q," the team recovered a row of carved staircase risers, one of which (Block V) records a visit by the Calakmul king Yuknoom Yich\'aak K\'ahk\' and ties his reign forward to the close of the 13th bak\'tun, 13.0.0.0.0 — the 21 December 2012 date. The text was read by epigrapher David Stuart and reported through Tulane University and Guatemala\'s PACUNAM, recording one of only two ancient Maya monuments naming the 2012 milestone.',
