    text: 'On 6 September 1634 a combined Imperial-Spanish army under Ferdinand of Hungary and the Cardinal-Infante Ferdinand of Spain decisively defeated the Swedish-German army of Gustav Horn and Bernhard of Saxe-Weimar at Nördlingen, shattering Swedish power in southern Germany and triggering direct French entry into the Thirty Years\' War.',
