        reason: 'In 1879 the landowner and amateur prehistorian Marcelino Sanz de Sautuola, exploring the cave with his young daughter María, recognised the ceiling figures as ancient paintings. In 1880, with the geologist Juan Vilanova y Piera, he published Breves apuntes sobre algunos objetos prehistóricos de la provincia de Santander, attributing the paintings to Palaeolithic humans.',
