        reason: 'Engelbart presented "A Research Center for Augmenting Human Intellect" to roughly 2,000 attendees, operating the NLS (oN-Line System) live from the conference hall while connected to SRI computers about 30 miles away in Menlo Park. The demo showcased the mouse, on-screen windows, hypertext linking, file collaboration and on-screen video of remote colleagues. The presentation was filmed and is preserved, fixing the date and content in the record.',
