    text: 'On 11 February 2020 the World Health Organization announced "COVID-19" as the official name of the disease caused by the novel coronavirus, while on the same day the International Committee on Taxonomy of Viruses named the virus itself "severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 (SARS-CoV-2)."',
