    text: 'On 4 October 1943, in a secret speech to SS officers in the town hall of Posen (Poznań), Heinrich Himmler explicitly described the ongoing extermination of the Jewish people — "the evacuation of the Jews, the extermination of the Jewish people" — speaking openly of the mass murder as official policy; a phonograph recording and an authorised transcript survive, making it one of the clearest contemporaneous documentary admissions that the Holocaust was a deliberate state programme.',
