        reason: 'Following Lavrentiy Beria\'s 10 May 1944 recommendation to Stalin and the State Defense Committee\'s GKO Order No. 5859ss of 11 May 1944, NKVD troops surrounded Crimean Tatar villages in the pre-dawn hours of 18 May 1944, giving families minutes to gather belongings before loading them onto freight trains. The operation was completed by 20 May 1944. The NKVD\'s own operational reports recorded the numbers deported and the special-settlement destinations, fixing the dates and scale in the contemporaneous Soviet record.',
