        reason: 'The finding was extended and confirmed when Kleitman with William Dement mapped the full cyclic architecture of sleep, correlating the rapid-eye-movement periods with a characteristic EEG stage and showing they recur four to six times per night. REM sleep became a settled, universally reproduced feature of mammalian sleep, the foundation of polysomnography and of all subsequent sleep-stage classification.',
