    text: 'In her 1936 paper "P′" the Danish seismologist Inge Lehmann demonstrated, from P-waves recorded at distant stations after large earthquakes, that the Earth\'s core is not wholly liquid: a distinct solid inner core lies within the molten outer core — overturning the prevailing view of an entirely fluid core.',
